# Context filter for the ONE repo-root-context image build: apps/nebula's build-box
# (wrangler.jsonc `image_build_context` → repo root; see container/Dockerfile's header
# for why the context is the root). Allowlist style — everything out, then exactly
# what that Dockerfile COPYs back in. A new COPY there needs a matching `!` here, or
# the build fails loudly on a missing path.
*
!apps/nebula/container
!apps/nebula/container/**
!apps/nebula/package.json
!apps/nebula/src
!apps/nebula/src/**
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/package.json
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/src
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/src/**
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/scripts
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/scripts/**
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/forks
!packages/ts-runtime-parser-validator/forks/**
# The vendored @lumenize frontend graph (see the Dockerfile's vendor stage).
!packages/mesh/package.json
!packages/mesh/src
!packages/mesh/src/**
!packages/crypto/package.json
!packages/crypto/src
!packages/crypto/src/**
!packages/debug/package.json
!packages/debug/src
!packages/debug/src/**
!packages/nebula-auth/package.json
!packages/nebula-auth/src
!packages/nebula-auth/src/**
!packages/routing/package.json
!packages/routing/src
!packages/routing/src/**
!packages/structured-clone/package.json
!packages/structured-clone/src
!packages/structured-clone/src/**

# Never ship dep trees or build output into the context (re-excludes them under the
# re-included dirs above — last match wins).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
**/coverage
